# caption: Compile bounded normalized dictionary entries into an identity transducer.

REQUIRE finite word/frequency entries; positive frequencies; length policy
ENSURE trie with one final entry per canonical spelling
FORALL entries DO
  validate type, frequency, and original extent; construct canonical key
  validate canonical extent; add frequency to that key's total
END FOR
allocate root state
FORALL canonical words in lexical order DO
  follow or create one identity arc per symbol
  mark final state and store merged frequency
END FOR

